{
  "$comment": "Owns: the LLM router's data — free-tier providers, exact model ids, per-quota RPM/RPD/TPM/TPD limits and the chains per job kind. Limits change: update the numbers and `checked`, not the code. Moved from SPEC §9's src/ai/providers.json into the llm module (apps/worker/src/modules/llm/providers.json).",
